## 📦 **Installation**

### Prerequisites

| Requirement | Check | Download |
|-------------|-------|----------|
| 🔹 **Python 3.10+** | `python --version` | [python.org](https://www.python.org/downloads/) |
| 🔹 **FFmpeg** | `ffmpeg -version` | [ffmpeg.org](https://ffmpeg.org/download.html) |

<details>
<summary><b>📥 FFmpeg Installation Details</b></summary>

| OS | Command / Method |
|----|------------------|
| **Windows** | Download from [ffmpeg.org](https://ffmpeg.org/download.html) and add `ffmpeg.exe` to PATH or place in project folder |
| **Mac** | `brew install ffmpeg` |
| **Linux** | `sudo apt install ffmpeg` (Ubuntu/Debian) <br> `sudo dnf install ffmpeg` (Fedora) |

</details>

### Quick Start

```bash
# 1️⃣ Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/duhemen/AetherPlayer.git
cd AetherPlayer

# 2️⃣ Create virtual environment
python -m venv aether_env

# 3️⃣ Activate virtual environment
# Windows
aether_env\Scripts\activate
# Mac/Linux
source aether_env/bin/activate

# 4️⃣ Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# 5️⃣ Run the application
python main.py
